          "rating": 5,
          "text": "I decided to step out and try something new, so I grabbed tickets and went to LIV Nightclub Miami to listen to music, meet new people, and just have a good time and it definitely delivered.\n\nThe night was packed and completely sold out, which made the energy feel crazy in a good way. The music was jumping all night, the crowd was lively, and the vibe stayed fun and exciting from start to finish. I met new people, had some good drinks, and really enjoyed the atmosphere.\n\nThe highlight of the night was seeing Tiësto perform live. Seeing a big-time DJ in person was an amazing experience and honestly made the whole night worth it.\n\nI’ll be real tickets and drinks are definitely on the pricey side but the vibes, music, and overall experience made it worth taking the chance. If you’re looking for a high-energy club night with top-tier DJs and a packed crowd, this is a great spot to check out.",
